{"seq":3,"slug":"remote-write-out-of-order-backpressure","title":"写入异常治理：remote write、乱序样本与背压","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/tsdb-model-ingestion/remote-write-out-of-order-backpressure","wordCount":2446,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"写入异常治理-remote-write-乱序样本与背压\">写入异常治理：remote write、乱序样本与背压</h1><p>样本从被监控进程到 TSDB 落盘，要穿过三道会出错的关口：抓取端时间戳可能因重试、代理缓存或时钟回拨而落后；remote write 端点可能拒绝、限流或下线；发送队列一旦塞满，Prometheus 会连带停掉整条 WAL 读取链路。本文按&quot;判据 → 错误语义 → 背压传导 → 观测与调参&quot;讲清每类写入异常在 Prometheus 3.14（2026-08）上的确切行为与默认值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类写入异常与它们的判据\">核心概念：三类写入异常与它们的判据</h2><p>写入失败不是同一种东西。乱序是&quot;样本合法但时间戳比该序列已知的最大时间还早&quot;；背压是&quot;样本合法且有序，但下游收得太慢&quot;；过期样本是两者的边界，既晚到得离谱又落出所有时间窗口之外。处置方式完全不同：乱序可用窗口接纳，背压只能靠扩并发或降量缓解，过期样本基本注定被丢弃。区分它们的第一依据是 TSDB Head 的 <code>MaxTime</code>——全库已见的最大时间戳（来源：源码 <code>tsdb/head_append.go</code>，v3.x）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n<th>错误标识</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t &gt; t_{\\text{last}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>正常追加</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = t_{\\text{last}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且值不同</td>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n<td><code>ErrDuplicateSampleForTimestamp</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t &lt; t_{\\text{last}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mtext>MaxTime</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\ge \\text{MaxTime} - W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MaxTime</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>作为乱序接纳</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t &lt; t_{\\text{last}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>MaxTime</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t &lt; \\text{MaxTime} - W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MaxTime</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n<td><code>ErrTooOldSample</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>MaxTime</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t &gt; \\text{MaxTime} + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MaxTime</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>（超出容差）</td>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n<td><code>ErrOutOfBounds</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 即 <code>tsdb.out_of_order_time_window</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的未来时间容差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，官方文档把 out-of-order 与 out-of-bounds 两类错误<strong>合并为单一的 <code>too-old</code> 语义</strong>：样本要么可摄入（有序，或落在窗口内的乱序/越界），要么就是 too-old（来源：配置文档 <code>&lt;tsdb&gt;</code> 段，默认 <code>0s</code>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[样本 t] --&gt; B{t 对比 t_last}&#10;    B --&gt;|更新| C[正常追加]&#10;    B --&gt;|相等且值不同| D[ErrDuplicateSampleForTimestamp]&#10;    B --&gt;|更早| E{t 对比 MaxTime - W}&#10;    E --&gt;|窗口内| F[写入 OOO 块]&#10;    E --&gt;|早于窗口| G[ErrTooOldSample]&#10;    C --&gt; H[WAL 追加]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I{remote write 队列}&#10;    I --&gt;|有空| J[shard 发送]&#10;    I --&gt;|填满| K[阻塞 WAL 读取&lt;br/&gt;全局吞吐归零]&#10;    J --&gt;|2xx| L[远端确认]&#10;    J --&gt;|4xx 非 429| M[永久丢弃]&#10;    J --&gt;|429/5xx| N[退避重试]\">graph TD\n    A[样本 t] --&gt; B{t 对比 t_last}\n    B --&gt;|更新| C[正常追加]\n    B --&gt;|相等且值不同| D[ErrDuplicateSampleForTimestamp]\n    B --&gt;|更早| E{t 对比 MaxTime - W}\n    E --&gt;|窗口内| F[写入 OOO 块]\n    E --&gt;|早于窗口| G[ErrTooOldSample]\n    C --&gt; H[WAL 追加]\n    F --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I{remote write 队列}\n    I --&gt;|有空| J[shard 发送]\n    I --&gt;|填满| K[阻塞 WAL 读取&lt;br/&gt;全局吞吐归零]\n    J --&gt;|2xx| L[远端确认]\n    J --&gt;|4xx 非 429| M[永久丢弃]\n    J --&gt;|429/5xx| N[退避重试]</pre><p>乱序样本在内存里的形态决定了窗口的代价。Head chunks 格式规定：chunk 的 <code>encoding</code> 字段最高位标记它是否乱序，落盘的 block chunk 从不设置这一位（来源：<code>tsdb/docs/format/head_chunks.md</code> &quot;OOO encoding&quot; 节）。乱序因此只是 Head 阶段的临时状态，压缩成 block 后与有序数据不再有格式差别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"乱序接纳-窗口大小-内存上限与它治不了的问题\">乱序接纳：窗口大小、内存上限与它治不了的问题</h2><p>打开乱序接纳只需在配置里加一行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"storage:&#10;  tsdb:&#10;    out_of_order_time_window: 30m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tsdb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    out_of_order_time_window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30m</span></span></code></pre></div><p>该选项可运行时重载（<code>tsdb</code> 段属 runtime-reloadable 配置），调整窗口不必重启进程；它同时作用于实验性的 agent 模式——开启后 agent 的 WAL 也接纳窗口内的乱序样本，判据是&quot;相对于同序列最后追加样本的时间戳&quot;（来源：配置文档 <code>&lt;tsdb&gt;</code> 段）。窗口开大不等于免费：乱序样本进 Head 后存放在独立 OOO 内存块里，无法与有序序列共享同一 chunks 区间，因为有序区尾部还在被追加。Prometheus 给单个内存 OOO 块设了硬上限——源码中的 <code>DefaultOutOfOrderCapMax</code> 为 <strong>32</strong>，<code>HeadOptions</code> 校验只接受 <code>1..255</code>（来源：<code>tsdb/head.go</code>）。块写满即切新块，窗口越大、乱序越分散，内存里的 OOO 块数越多。</p>\n<p>2026 年修掉的两个缺陷说明这条路径的复杂度仍在收敛（来源：<code>CHANGELOG.md</code>，3.14.0 / 2026-08-17）：<code>#19016</code>「out-of-order ingestion 开启且 block 被压缩时，重启可能静默丢数据」，正落在&quot;乱序 + 压缩&quot;交汇处；<code>#19013</code>「乱序查询会阻塞压缩数小时，导致内存持续增长」，说明乱序还会通过查询侧反噬压缩调度。窗口应覆盖你<strong>真实</strong>的迟到原因上限——抓取重试与短暂抖动只需几分钟，边缘节点离线回补则需按回补时长设并评估 OOO 内存占用。抓取侧标签与 staleness 处理会在样本进入判据之前就改变时间戳序列，见同章《抓取接入管道：服务发现、relabel 与 staleness 处理》(./2_scrape-service-discovery-relabel.md)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"remote-write-2-0-的错误语义-哪些该重试-哪些永远不该\">Remote Write 2.0 的错误语义：哪些该重试，哪些永远不该</h2><p>弄不清&quot;该不该重试&quot;是背压被放大的常见根因。Remote Write 2.0 规范（发布候选，日期 May 2024）把 HTTP 语义写得很死（引自 <code>X-Prometheus-Remote-Write-Version</code> 与 Error Cases 各节）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态码</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>发送端行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2xx（推荐 204）</td>\n<td>全部数据已写入</td>\n<td>成功，忽略响应体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>202 Accepted</td>\n<td>异步接收方已入队、尚未完成校验</td>\n<td>接受，但不得据此推断已写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>400 / 415</td>\n<td>请求含非法样本 / 内容类型或编码不支持</td>\n<td>400 <strong>MUST NOT</strong> 重试；415 可换编码重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>429 Too Many Requests</td>\n<td>接收方过载</td>\n<td><strong>MAY</strong> 重试（可选），可读 <code>Retry-After</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5xx</td>\n<td>接收方内部错误</td>\n<td><strong>MUST</strong> 重试，且 <strong>MUST</strong> 用退避算法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>规则里最关键的是「Senders MUST NOT retry on a 4xx HTTP status codes (other than 429)」。看一个真实修复就明白它的分量：Prometheus 曾把 <code>ErrTooOldSample</code> 返回成 HTTP 500 而非 400，导致客户端陷入无限重试循环（来源：<code>CHANGELOG.md</code> 条目 <code>#13335</code>，OTLP 路径同类问题见 <code>#18084</code>）。<strong>一个错误的状态码会把一条注定失败的样本变成永久的流量放大器</strong>——这正是乱序治理与背压治理咬合的地方。Prometheus 自身作为接收方时，<code>storage/remote/write_handler.go</code> 把这四个乱序相关错误一律映射为 <code>http.StatusBadRequest</code>，其余才落到 500：乱序样本从远端 Prometheus 的角度看<strong>不可重试</strong>。</p>\n<p>2.0 还引入逐类件确认计数：接收方 <code>MUST</code> 返回 <code>X-Prometheus-Remote-Write-{Samples,Histograms,Exemplars}-Written</code> 三个响应头，解决 1.0 时代「请求部分写入成功」无法辨别的老问题。规范警告：2xx 或 4xx 下缺失的头可按 0 处理，但 202 下<strong>不能</strong>，因为异步接收方可能推迟校验。消息体结构上，<code>io.prometheus.write.v2.Request</code> 的符号表首位 <code>MUST</code> 为空字符串，且 <strong>samples 与 histograms 按时间戳升序排列（旧的在前）</strong>——2.0 仍假设<strong>单个请求内</strong>样本有序，跨请求的乱序才是需要窗口去兜的部分（来源：spec 的 protobuf 注释）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"背压-队列填满如何冻结整条-wal-读取链路\">背压：队列填满如何冻结整条 WAL 读取链路</h2><p>背压的失败模式是<strong>全局的</strong>，这才是它值得单独讲的原因。官方调优文档（Remote write tuning）说得很直接：每个目的地有一个队列，队列从 WAL 读取；样本进入某个 shard 的内存队列；当<strong>任意一个</strong> shard 的队列填满时，「Prometheus 会阻塞从 WAL 读取到任何 shard」，此后「所有吞吐都将停止」。两个结论随之而来：<strong>一个慢 shard 能拖停整个实例的写入</strong>（动态分片只是缓解，不是隔离）；<strong>WAL 是唯一缓冲且容量有限</strong>——段文件默认 128 MB，至少保留 3 个段，高流量实例保留更多以覆盖至少两小时原始数据（来源：存储文档 &quot;On-disk layout&quot;）。合起来就是那条最常被引用的红线：<strong>远端下线超过约 2 小时，WAL 会被压缩，尚未发送的数据就丢了</strong>（来源：Remote write tuning）。agent 模式同理：数据成功写入后立即从自定义 WAL 移除，但离线缓冲同样受两小时上限约束（来源：Prometheus Agent 文档）。</p>\n<p>队列内存可估算：每 shard 内存与 <code>capacity + max_samples_per_send</code> 成正比，官方称默认值下「每个 shard 小于 2 MB」；完整实例另有约 25% 内存增幅，含序列 ID 到标签的映射缓存。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>shards</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>capacity</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>max_samples_per_send</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{queue}} \\approx N_{\\text{shards}} \\cdot (\\text{capacity} + \\text{max\\_samples\\_per\\_send}) \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shards</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">capacity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_samples_per_send</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。官方建议：<strong>提高 <code>capacity</code> 或 <code>max_samples_per_send</code> 时，考虑降低 <code>max_shards</code></strong>；另一关键比例是 <code>capacity</code> 取 <code>max_samples_per_send</code> 的 <strong>3 到 10 倍</strong>。完整默认值如下（来源：配置文档 <code>queue_config</code> 段，v3.14）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>作用与调参方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>capacity</code></td>\n<td><code>10000</code></td>\n<td>每 shard 缓冲样本数；建议为 <code>max_samples_per_send</code> 的 3–10 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_shards</code> / <code>min_shards</code></td>\n<td><code>50</code> / <code>1</code></td>\n<td>每目的地并发上下限；除非端点极慢，一般不必上调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_samples_per_send</code></td>\n<td><code>2000</code></td>\n<td>单请求批量；与 <code>capacity</code> 同调时须反降 <code>max_shards</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>batch_send_deadline</code></td>\n<td><code>5s</code></td>\n<td>未满批也强制发送的最长等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min_backoff</code> / <code>max_backoff</code></td>\n<td><code>30ms</code> / <code>5s</code></td>\n<td>重试延迟起点与上限，每次失败翻倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retry_on_http_429</code> / <code>sample_age_limit</code></td>\n<td><code>false</code> / <code>0s</code></td>\n<td>是否重试 429；超龄样本不发送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>remote_timeout</code></td>\n<td><code>30s</code></td>\n<td>单次请求超时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>sample_age_limit</code> 是这里的隐形主角：它让发送端主动丢弃超过阈值的样本，<strong>把&quot;远端慢&quot;转化为&quot;本地丢&quot;</strong>，避免队列无限堆积，对离线回补、跨区域复制比调大 <code>capacity</code> 更直接。远端 payload 落地后的存储形态（chunk 压缩、block 与索引）决定同样的写入量最终占多少磁盘，见《块、chunk 与索引：TSDB 磁盘格式剖析》(../2_storage-compaction-index/1_block-chunk-index-format.md)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性与排障-先看哪几个指标\">可观测性与排障：先看哪几个指标</h2><p>排障沿数据流逆推：先确认乱序/过期率，再看队列积压，最后定位到哪个 shard 慢。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>prometheus_tsdb_head_out_of_order_samples_appended_total</code></td>\n<td>已接纳的乱序样本（counter，带 <code>type</code> 标签）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prometheus_tsdb_too_old_samples_total</code></td>\n<td>被拒绝的过期样本（counter）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prometheus_tsdb_sample_ooo_delta</code></td>\n<td>乱序样本&quot;迟到多少秒&quot;分布（histogram，<code>#17477</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prometheus_remote_storage_samples_pending</code></td>\n<td>队列中未发送样本，背压先行指标（gauge）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prometheus_remote_storage_shards_desired</code> / <code>_max</code></td>\n<td>建议 shard 数与当前上限（gauge）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prometheus_remote_storage_samples_{failed,dropped}_total</code></td>\n<td>发送失败/被丢弃样本数（counter）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prometheus_remote_storage_queue_highest_sent_timestamp_seconds</code></td>\n<td>已发送最新时间戳，用于算 lag（gauge）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>诊断三步。<strong>第一步</strong>：<code>sample_ooo_delta</code> 分布尾部若超出 <code>out_of_order_time_window</code>，说明窗口设小了，<code>too_old_samples_total</code> 会同步增长。<strong>第二步</strong>：<code>samples_pending</code> 持续爬升说明接近阻塞点；配合 <code>queue_highest_sent_timestamp_seconds</code> 与当前时间的差可算出&quot;还能撑多久到两小时&quot;。<strong>第三步</strong>：若 <code>shards</code> 已顶到 <code>shards_max</code> 而 pending 仍在涨，说明单端点并发天花板已到——正确动作是降低本地发送量（<code>write_relabel_configs</code> 裁剪、<code>sample_age_limit</code> 止损）或扩容接收端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>写入异常分三类，判据落在 Head 的 <code>MaxTime</code>：有序追加、窗口内乱序接纳、窗口外 too-old 拒绝。</li>\n<li><code>tsdb.out_of_order_time_window</code> 默认 <code>0s</code>，可运行时重载；开启后 out-of-order 与 out-of-bounds 合并为 <code>too-old</code>；乱序块内存上限 <code>DefaultOutOfOrderCapMax</code> 为 32。</li>\n<li>Remote Write 2.0 错误语义是硬约束：4xx（429 除外）<strong>禁止</strong>重试，5xx <strong>必须</strong>退避重试，<code>too_old</code> 必须返回 400（<code>#13335</code>）。</li>\n<li>背压是全局故障：任一 shard 队列填满即阻塞 WAL 读取、吞吐归零；WAL 只能缓冲约两小时。</li>\n<li>队列内存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>shards</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>capacity</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>max_samples_per_send</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx N_{\\text{shards}} \\cdot (\\text{capacity} + \\text{max\\_samples\\_per\\_send})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shards</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">capacity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_samples_per_send</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；调大批量或容量时应下调 <code>max_shards</code>。</li>\n<li>排障按 <code>sample_ooo_delta</code> → <code>too_old_samples_total</code> → <code>samples_pending</code> → <code>shards_desired/shards_max</code> 推进。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"写入异常治理：remote write、乱序样本与背压","id":"写入异常治理-remote-write-乱序样本与背压"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类写入异常与它们的判据","id":"核心概念-三类写入异常与它们的判据"},{"level":2,"text":"乱序接纳：窗口大小、内存上限与它治不了的问题","id":"乱序接纳-窗口大小-内存上限与它治不了的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"Remote Write 2.0 的错误语义：哪些该重试，哪些永远不该","id":"remote-write-2-0-的错误语义-哪些该重试-哪些永远不该"},{"level":2,"text":"背压：队列填满如何冻结整条 WAL 读取链路","id":"背压-队列填满如何冻结整条-wal-读取链路"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性与排障：先看哪几个指标","id":"可观测性与排障-先看哪几个指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"抓取接入管道：服务发现、relabel 与 staleness 处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/tsdb-model-ingestion/scrape-service-discovery-relabel"},"next":{"title":"块、chunk 与倒排索引：存储布局与文件格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/storage-compaction-index/block-chunk-index-format"}}